{"id":"en_the-jewel-i-wouldn-t-give","title":"The Jewel I Wouldn't Give","titleEn":"The Jewel I Wouldn't Give","description":"Tech CEO Elena launches a company while concealing her true identity, but her husband Liam, who lives off her earnings, conspires with Jessica—introduced as Elena's sister—to seize her entire fortune. At a banquet celebrating a financing deal, a creditor named Mrs. Sterling arrives with bodyguards to humiliate Elena publicly, even attempting to strip her and photograph her nude, while investors begin withdrawing their support. Facing this crisis, Elena reaches out to her father, a man she has not contacted in five years, and discovers she is an heir to the Rothschild family. The series and its episodes can be followed on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-jewel-i-wouldnt-give/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-jewel-i-wouldnt-give/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Revenge","Rich Family Feud","Underdog Rise","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ds304/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-jewel-i-wouldn-t-give_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ds304/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-jewel-i-wouldn-t-give_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ds304/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-jewel-i-wouldn-t-give_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7ds304/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-jewel-i-wouldn-t-give_4","title":"Episode 4","season